@startuml fab-env-hvac
!include uml-palette.puml
title Fab Automation - Environment / HVAC / Power (ADR-FAB-004) - tag: env-hvac

component "Second-bathroom HVAC\nprinter room conditioning" as HVAC1 <<service>>
component "2x Tripp Lite rack HVAC\nSNMP, remote on/off, temp ctl" as HVAC2 <<service>>
component "Printer space\nK1 Max, door + lid OPEN\n(room is the chamber)" as ROOM <<special>>
component "Home server rack\nM70 / Orin / Forge plant" as RACK <<service>>
component "12V fan inventory\n40-140 mm, printed ducting" as FANS <<side>>

component "Hubitat C8\nZ-Wave, sensors, outlets" as C8 <<ingest>>
component "Prometheus scraper\nSNMP + house metrics" as PROM <<store>>
component "Z-Wave outlet monitor\nprinter power lifecycle" as OUTLET <<ingest>>
component "SLURM print job\non -> print -> cool -> off" as JOB <<core>>
component "Fire-class interlock\nsmoke / wattage / anomaly" as FIRE <<alert>>

HVAC1 --> ROOM : conditioned air
HVAC2 --> RACK : rack cooling
FANS ..> ROOM : ducting as needed
FANS ..> RACK
C8 --> PROM : environmental series
HVAC2 --> PROM : SNMP metrics
ROOM --> C8 : temp / humidity / presence
JOB --> OUTLET : power lifecycle
OUTLET --> ROOM : printer power + watts
FIRE --> OUTLET : hard cut (fire-class only)
C8 --> FIRE : smoke alarm state

note bottom of ROOM
  Protocols in scope: Z-Wave via C8, Ethernet,
  RTSP/NDI, Moonraker, SNMP/Prometheus.
  Matter / Thread: explicitly out (Eva, 2026-11-26).
end note

legend right
  |= Role |= Meaning |
  | <<service>> | HVAC + spaces + rack |
  | <<special>> | printer space (open chamber) |
  | <<ingest>> | C8 + outlet control path |
  | <<store>> | Prometheus |
  | <<core>> | print job lifecycle |
  | <<alert>> | fire-class interlock |
  | <<side>> | fan inventory |
endlegend
@enduml
